sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as Staff (Account Moderator - S-06 & S-07)
    actor TargetUser as Target Citizen / Recycler
    participant Guard as AccountStatusGuardMiddleware
    participant Perm as PermissionAuthorizationHandler
    participant Ctrl as StaffAccountsController
    participant Val as LockOrUnlockAccountValidator / DeactivateAccountValidator
    participant Svc as AccountGovernanceService
    participant Cache as MemoryAuthStateCacheInvalidator
    participant Audit as AuditLogService
    participant Mail as IEmailService
    participant DB as ApplicationDbContext (PostgreSQL)

    Note over Staff, DB: 1. Nhân viên tra cứu danh sách & chi tiết tài khoản (UC S-06 - RBAC MANAGE_ACCOUNTS)
    Staff->>Guard: Request GET /api/v1/staff/accounts [JWT Staff]
    Guard->>DB: Load UserAuthSnapshot (check Active)
    Guard-->>Perm: Next -> Check [HasPermission("MANAGE_ACCOUNTS")]
    alt Staff không có quyền MANAGE_ACCOUNTS
        Perm-->>Staff: 403 Forbidden (BR-ADM-02, MSG-ADM-04)
    else Có quyền MANAGE_ACCOUNTS hoặc Admin
        Perm->>Ctrl: Forward to StaffAccountsController
        Ctrl->>Svc: GetAccountsAsync(filter, ct)
        Svc->>DB: Query Users WHERE Role IN (User, Recycler) + HandoverRequests Completed count
        DB-->>Svc: PagedResult<ManagedAccountSummaryDto>
        Svc-->>Ctrl: PagedResult<ManagedAccountSummaryDto>
        Ctrl-->>Staff: 200 OK ApiResponse (MSG-GEN-01)
    end

    Staff->>Ctrl: GET /api/v1/staff/accounts/{userId}
    Ctrl->>Svc: GetAccountDetailAsync(userId, ct)
    Svc->>DB: Load User, RecyclerProfile, EcoProfile, ActivityStats & 20 ModerationLogs
    DB-->>Svc: ManagedAccountDetailDto
    Ctrl-->>Staff: 200 OK ApiResponse<ManagedAccountDetailDto>

    Note over Staff, TargetUser: 2. Tạm khóa tài khoản vi phạm & thu hồi phiên tức thời (UC S-07 - BR-ADM-03)
    Staff->>Ctrl: PATCH /api/v1/staff/accounts/{userId}/lock { isLocked: true, reason }
    Ctrl->>Val: ValidateAsync(request)
    alt Reason rỗng hoặc < 10 ký tự
        Val-->>Ctrl: IsValid = false
        Ctrl-->>Staff: 400 Bad Request (MSG-GEN-01)
    else Hợp lệ
        Val-->>Ctrl: IsValid = true
        Ctrl->>Svc: LockOrUnlockAccountAsync(actorId, targetUserId, request)
        alt Target là Staff/Admin hoặc actorId == targetUserId
            Svc-->>Ctrl: Throw ForbiddenAccessException("BR-ADM-03", "MSG-ADM-04")
            Ctrl-->>Staff: 403 Forbidden (MSG-ADM-04)
        else Target là Citizen hoặc Recycler
            Svc->>DB: Set User.Status = Suspended, Increment WarningCount, Save ModerationReason
            Svc->>DB: Revoke all active RefreshTokens (IsRevoked = true)
            opt Target là Recycler
                Svc->>DB: Set RecyclerProfile.ActiveStatus = Offline
            end
            Svc->>DB: Insert AccountModerationLog & SaveChangesAsync()
            Svc->>Cache: InvalidateUserAuthState(targetUserId) [Remove auth_snapshot:{userId}]
            Svc->>Audit: LogAsync("LOCK_ACCOUNT", "User", targetUserId, reason)
            Svc->>Mail: TryNotifyAccountStatusChangedAsync(user, reason)
            Svc-->>Ctrl: ManagedAccountSummaryDto
            Ctrl-->>Staff: 200 OK ApiResponse (MSG-ADM-03)
        end
    end

    Note over TargetUser, DB: Tài khoản vừa bị khóa gửi request bằng JWT Access Token cũ vẫn còn hạn
    TargetUser->>Guard: GET /api/v1/auth/me [Old valid JWT]
    Guard->>DB: Cache missed -> Reload UserAuthSnapshot -> Status == Suspended
    Guard-->>TargetUser: 403 Forbidden (BR-AUTH-05, MSG-AUTH-04)

    Note over Staff, DB: 3. Vô hiệu hóa mềm bảo toàn biên nhận lịch sử (UC S-07 - BR-ADM-04)
    Staff->>Ctrl: DELETE /api/v1/staff/accounts/{userId} { reason }
    Ctrl->>Val: DeactivateAccountValidator.ValidateAsync(request)
    Ctrl->>Svc: DeactivateAccountAsync(actorId, targetUserId, request)
    Svc->>DB: Soft-Deactivate User.Status = Deactivated (Giữ nguyên User & HandoverReceipts FK)
    Svc->>DB: Revoke RefreshTokens, Set Recycler Offline, Insert AccountModerationLog
    Svc->>Cache: InvalidateUserAuthState(targetUserId)
    Svc->>Audit: LogAsync("DEACTIVATE_ACCOUNT", "User", targetUserId, newValues={preservedCompletedDeals})
    Ctrl-->>Staff: 200 OK ApiResponse (MSG-ADM-03)
